# the real mouse (x16emu -mousescript, R49), a whole session: Klondike #1,
# 40 actions of the simple player (presses, drags, double clicks, deals)
# as PS/2 packets; the test build saves the state and the screen after
# every move (the script pauses after each action meanwhile)
game 0 1
realmouse
auto 40
state
end 60
